<title>NETHERLANDS: BZW downgrades DSM '96, '97 EPS estimates.</title>
<headline>BZW downgrades DSM '96, '97 EPS estimates.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of prelim results flash.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>DSM		 Chemicals     176.00  Barclays Zoete Wedd.</p>
<p>COMMENT: Hold. 1996, 1997 EPS downgraded on disappointing results indication. A one guilder increase in 1996 dividend is expected, but similar rise in 1997 no longer seen. Q4 operating income seen at 174 million guilders, lowest for the year. Lowly 7 pct operating margins due to higher raw material costs braking plastic margin recovery. Any improvement in 1997 earnings will be short-lived, margin pressure at polymers and hydrocarbons not seen abating until at least first half of 1997.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	29.6    (n/a)     5.9     8.00</p>
<p>    1996		   23.9    (25.50)   7.4     9.00</p>
<p>    1997		   25.20   (27.50)   7.0     9.00</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
